# Code owners for blumkin.
#
# `*` covers every path, so @thehcma is a required reviewer on every pull
# request. Combined with branch protection on `main`
# (require_code_owner_reviews + required_approving_review_count >= 1 +
# require_last_push_approval), nothing merges without the code owner's review -
# see CONTRIBUTING.md and SECURITY.md.
#
# Do not add narrower rules unless a path genuinely needs a *different* owner:
# with multiple entries the last matching line wins, so a stray rule can
# silently drop @thehcma from a path.

* @thehcma
